return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T19:55:52+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T19:55:52+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'Huchapisha tovuti hii katika kila lugha unayochagua, kwenye anwani zake za wavuti, ikiwa na vipande vya URL vilivyotafsiriwa, metadata, menyu, bidhaa za WooCommerce, hreflang, ramani za tovuti kwa kila lugha na llms.txt. Tafsiri ukitumia mpango wako wa Zinn Digital® au ukitumia ufunguo wako wa mtoa huduma.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Andika thamani mpya ili kuibadilisha.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii…','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana na kichujio hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu mlalo','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu mlalo hii','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Copied'=>'Imenakiliwa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila programu-jalizi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na ikiwa inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Weka upya kwa chaguomsingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii itarejesha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii kuwa chaguomsingi. Je, ungependa kuendelea?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Uchunguzi kwa ajili ya usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Ingiza faili la mipangilio','Import'=>'Leta','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizohamishwa hazina nywila, tokeni au funguo za API kamwe — utahitaji kuziingiza tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerejeshwa kwenye chaguomsingi yake.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa. Chagua faili ya mipangilio iliyohamishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo ni kubwa mno kuwa uhamishaji wa mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo siyo faili ya uhamishaji wa mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hiyo ilihamishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi tofauti (%s), kwa hivyo kuiingiza hapa kutahifadhi mipangilio ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mipangilio %d imeingizwa. Manenosiri na funguo za API hazijumuishwi kamwe katika faili ya kuhamisha, kwa hivyo ziweke tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeagizwa. Manenosiri na vitufe vya API havijumuishwi kamwe katika uhamishaji, kwa hivyo viingize tena.','Translate'=>'Tafsiri','Manual overrides'=>'Ubatilishaji wa mikono','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'Ramani za tovuti na URL','General'=>'Jumla','Who pays for the translation'=>'Ni nani anayelipia tafsiri','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'Iwe mpango wako wa Zinn Digital®, au ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa API. Hakuna daraja la bure — kuna mtu anayemlipa mtoa huduma kwa kila neno.','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'Mpango wangu wa Zinn Digital®','My own provider key'=>'Ufunguo wangu wa mtoa huduma','Site ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha Tovuti','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'Kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®, kwenye kichupo cha Translation cha tovuti hii.','Site token'=>'Tokeni ya tovuti','An API key from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on its API keys page. Give it the sites.view and sites.translation.manage permissions.'=>'Ufunguo wa API kutoka dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®, kwenye ukurasa wake wa funguo za API. Upe ruhusa za sites.view na sites.translation.manage.','Provider'=>'Mtoa huduma','API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'Ufunguo wako, uliotozwa kwako na mtoa huduma. Umehifadhiwa kwenye tovuti hii na hutumwa kwao pekee.','Model'=>'Muundo','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'Acha wazi kwa muundo wa bei nafuu zaidi unaofanya kazi vizuri.','This site is written in'=>'Tovuti hii imeandikwa kwa','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'Acha wazi ili kutumia lugha ya tovuti kutoka kwa mipangilio ya WordPress.','Languages to publish'=>'Lugha za kuchapisha','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'Kila moja hupata anwani zake za wavuti na ramani yake ya tovuti. Chapisha lugha zile tu unazotaka ziorodheshwe.','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'Tafsiri kiotomatiki ninapochapisha au kusasisha','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'Kuhariri ukurasa kunaashiria tafsiri zake kuwa zimepitwa na wakati na zinaundwa upya chinichini. Kuhariri bila kubadilisha maneno yoyote hakugharimu chochote.','What gets translated'=>'Kinachotafsiriwa','Post types'=>'Aina za machapisho','Translate the web addresses too'=>'Tafsiri anwani za wavuti pia','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'Wageni wa Kifaransa wanapata /fr/a-propos/ badala ya /fr/about/. Anwani ambayo haijatafsiriwa inaendelea kufanya kazi na inaelekeza kwingine, kwa hivyo hakuna chochote kilichoorodheshwa kinachoharibika.','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'Tafsiri vichwa vya SEO, maelezo na matini mbadala ya picha','Translate categories and tags'=>'Tafsiri kategoria na lebo','Translate navigation menus'=>'Tafsiri menyu za urambazaji','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'Tafsiri bidhaa na sifa za WooCommerce','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'Maelezo mafupi, madokezo ya ununuzi, lebo za sifa na maelezo ya aina mbalimbali. Bei, SKUs na thamani za chaguo zilizohifadhiwa haziguswi kamwe.','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'Ongeza lebo za hreflang','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'Huarifu injini tafuti kwamba kurasa hizi ni ukurasa uleule katika lugha tofauti. Acha hii ikiwa imewashwa isipokuwa kama programu-jalizi nyingine tayari inafanya hivyo.','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'Chapisha ramani ya tovuti kwa kila lugha','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'Chapisha llms.txt kwa kila lugha','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'Ramani ya maandishi wazi ya tovuti ambayo injini za majibu za AI husoma. Mara nyingi haziwezi kuendesha JavaScript na huenda zisiwahi kuleta ramani ya tovuti.','Language switcher'=>'Kibadilisha lugha','Style'=>'Mtindo','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'Rangi, nafasi na pembe ziko kwenye kichupo cha Mtindo. Iweke kwa kizuizi, msimbo mfupi wa [zinn_language_switcher], au menyu.','Show only these languages'=>'Onyesha lugha hizi pekee','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'Acha wazi ili kuonyesha kila lugha unayochapisha.','Name each language in its own language'=>'Taja kila lugha kwa lugha yake yenyewe','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Deutsch badala ya German. Mtu ambaye hawezi kusoma ukurasa wa sasa hawezi kusoma "German" pia.','Show flags'=>'Onyesha bendera','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'Imezimwa kwa chaguo-msingi: lugha si nchi, na Kiarabu na Kihispania havina bendera moja ambayo haitengi wazungumzaji wake wengi.','Include the language being read'=>'Jumuisha lugha inayosomeka','Include the original language'=>'Jumuisha lugha asili','Add it to this menu'=>'Iongeze kwenye menyu hii','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'Menyu unayoitaja hapa pekee. Hakuna kinachoongezwa kwenye menyu nyingine yoyote kwenye tovuti.','Accent'=>'Lafudhi','Background'=>'Mandhari nyuma','Text'=>'Maandishi','Corner radius'=>'Kipenyo cha pembe','Spacing'=>'Nafasi','Text size'=>'Ukubwa wa maandishi','Do not add it to a menu'=>'Usiongeze kwenye menyu','none'=>'hakuna','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard, under "Shown to visitors". This site checks it every hour. Publishing now: %s.'=>'Kwenye mpango wa Zinn Digital® unachagua lugha za kuchapisha kwenye kichupo cha Tafsiri cha tovuti hii kwenye dashibodi yako, chini ya "Inaonyeshwa kwa wageni". Tovuti hii huangalia kila saa. Inachapisha sasa: %s.','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard. This site has not read that choice yet, so it is still publishing: %s. Check the Site ID and token above.'=>'Kwenye mpango wa Zinn Digital®, unachagua lugha za kuchapisha kwenye kichupo cha Tafsiri cha tovuti hii kwenye dashibodi yako. Tovuti hii bado haijasoma chaguo hilo, kwa hivyo bado inachapisha: %s. Angalia Kitambulisho cha Tovuti na tokeni hapo juu.','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'Hariri tafsiri yoyote hapa. Tafsiri iliyohaririwa huwekwa sawasawa na jinsi ulivyoandika na haifutwi ukurasa unapotafsiriwa tena.','Every language'=>'Kila lugha','Search translations'=>'Tafuta tafsiri','Filter'=>'Chuja','Content'=>'Maudhui','Language'=>'Lugha','Translation'=>'Tafsiri','Status'=>'Hali','Save'=>'Hifadhi','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'Bado hakuna kilichotafsiriwa. Chapisha lugha na tafsiri itaanza chinichini.','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'Anwani hizi ziko hewani. Fungua yoyote kati yazo ili kuikagua, na uwasilishe fahirisi ya ramani ya tovuti kwenye Google Search Console.','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuhariri tafsiri kwenye tovuti hii.','Edited by you — kept'=>'Imehaririwa na wewe — imehifadhiwa','Source changed — will be redone'=>'Chanzo kimebadilika — kitarudiwa','Up to date'=>'Ya kisasa zaidi','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna jambo linalohitaji uangalizi','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inatumika kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatuwezi kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Programu-jalizi hii haikueleza sababu. Tuma ripoti ya uchunguzi nasi tutaiangalia.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Ilikaguliwa mara ya mwisho %s iliyopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(inafunguka kwenye kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hiki ndicho hasa kitakachotumwa — hakuna kingine, na hakuna chochote kilichofichwa. Manenosiri yako, tokeni na funguo za API hazimo ndani yake.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao wa kunakili','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tiketi ya msaada na kujibu kwa barua pepe. Ikiwa ungependelea kutoituma, inakili hapo juu na uibandike mwenyewe kwenye tiketi.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatuwezi kufikia Zinn Digital® kutoka seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tiketi badala yake — hakuna hitilafu yoyote katika mipangilio yako.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Dawati la usaidizi la Zinn® limepokea ripoti yako na litajibu kupitia barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako — rejeleo %s — na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena — ripoti za awali zimefika.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kupokea ripoti sasa hivi — hilo ni tatizo la upande wetu, si wako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti imekataliwa (HTTP %d). Inakili hapo juu na ufungue tiketi, ukitaja nambari hiyo.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Ukaribishaji wa Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha tovuti zaidi ya moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizothibitiwa, vikoa na uwekaji wa viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili zitakapoidhinisha.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — waajiri watu wanaofanya kazi hii ili kujipatia riziki','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari zaidi ya huduma 10,000 zilizo tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutoa zabuni.','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'Ufunguo wa API umekataliwa. Hakikisha kuwa bado ni halali na una idhini ya kufikia tafsiri, kisha uhifadhi tena.','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'Mtoa huduma amekataa kwa sababu ya malipo au kiwango cha mgawo. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa. Angalia salio na vikomo kwenye akaunti yako naye.','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa tafsiri ana tatizo upande wake. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa au kutozwa, na itajaribu tena katika mzunguko unaofuata.','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'Ombi la tafsiri lilishindikana na hatukuweza kubaini sababu. Hakuna kilichohifadhiwa.','Sitemap index'=>'Kielezo cha ramani ya tovuti','%s sitemap'=>'Ramani ya tovuti ya %s','LLM content map'=>'Ramani ya maudhui ya LLM','%s LLM content map'=>'Ramani ya maudhui ya LLM ya %s','Languages published'=>'Lugha zilizochapishwa','Site language'=>'Lugha ya Tovuti','SEO plugin'=>'Programu-jalizi ya SEO','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'Bado hakuna mtoa huduma wa tafsiri aliyesanidiwa.','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'Bandika ufunguo wa API kutoka kwa mtoa huduma uliyemchagua, au unganisha tovuti kwenye akaunti ya Zinn Digital®, na tafsiri itaanza kwenye mkondo unaofuata.','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'Inatafsiri kwa kutumia ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa %s.','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa kwenye akaunti ya Zinn Digital®, ambayo ni sawa — mtoa huduma wako anakutoza bili moja kwa moja.','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'Bado haijaunganishwa na Zinn Digital®.','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'Ongeza kitambulisho na tokeni ya tovuti hii kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®, au badilisha utumie ufunguo wako wa mtoa huduma ili uendeshe bila akaunti.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Imeunganishwa kwenye Zinn Digital®.','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa tafsiri anakabiliwa na tatizo.','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'Tafsiri imesitishwa — mtoa huduma wako anahitaji kushughulikiwa.','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'Tafsiri bado haijasanidiwa.','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'Kuna hitilafu iliyotokea upande wetu.','Check their status page'=>'Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali','Fix this on your account'=>'Rekebisha hili kwenye akaunti yako','Style preset'=>'Seti ya awali ya mtindo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Hatua ya kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinachukua nafasi yake.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Acha hii ikiwa imezimwa na seti ya awali itatumiwa jinsi ilivyo.','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Kibadilisha lugha cha Zinn®','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'Ruhusu wageni wasome ukurasa huu katika lugha nyingine.','Title'=>'Kichwa','Use the plugin setting'=>'Tumia mpangilio wa programu-jalizi','Dropdown'=>'Menyu kunjuzi','Inline list'=>'Orodha ya ndani ya mstari','Pills'=>'Vidonge','Minimal text'=>'Maandishi machache','Flags and names'=>'Bendera na majina','Stacked list'=>'Orodha iliyopangwa kwa tabaka','Choose a language'=>'Chagua lugha','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama madokezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya usasishaji ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa usasishaji huu. Hakikisha kuwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia mfumo wa Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa uthibitishaji wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Hakuna ufunguo wa API wa DeepL uliohifadhiwa, kwa hivyo hakuna kitu cha kutafsiri nacho.','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL haitafsiri kwa %s. Chagua Google Gemini au OpenAI kwa lugha hii, au unganisha tovuti na Zinn Digital®.','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Haikuweza kuwasiliana na DeepL. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa na hakuna kilichotozwa; itajaribu tena katika awamu inayofuata.','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'Kiwango chako cha herufi za DeepL kimetumika chote kwa kipindi hiki. Tafsiri itaendelea kitakapowekwa upya, au utakapoongeza kikomo kwenye akaunti yako ya DeepL.','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL ilijibu kwa kitu ambacho hatukuweza kusoma. Hakuna kilichohifadhiwa.','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Hakuna ufunguo wa Google Gemini API uliohifadhiwa, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kutafsiri.','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Haikuweza kufikia Google Gemini. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa na hakuna kilichotozwa; itajaribu tena katika awamu inayofuata.','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Hakuna ufunguo wa OpenAI API uliohifadhiwa, kwa hivyo hakuna chochote cha kutafsiri nacho.','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'OpenAI haikuweza kufikiwa. Hakuna kilichotafsiriwa na hakuna kilichotozwa; itajaribu tena katika awamu inayofuata.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa na Zinn Digital®, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kukusanya. Ongeza Kitambulisho cha Tovuti na tokeni, au ubadilishe utumie ufunguo wako mwenyewe wa mtoa huduma.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa na Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Haikuweza kuwasiliana na Zinn Digital®. Hakuna kilichotumwa; itajaribu tena katika awamu inayofuata.','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Tafsiri imesitishwa kwenye tovuti hii. Angalia kama akaunti imesasishwa kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. It must be an API key with the sites.view and sites.translation.manage permissions — create one on the API keys page of your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® imekataa tokeni ya tovuti hii. Lazima iwe ufunguo wa API wenye ruhusa za sites.view na sites.translation.manage — unda moja kwenye ukurasa wa funguo za API katika dashibodi yako.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Haikuweza kufikia Zinn Digital®. Tovuti yako inaendelea kutoa tafsiri ilizonazo tayari.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® ilijibu kwa kitu ambacho hatukuweza kusoma. Tovuti yako inaendelea kutoa tafsiri ambazo tayari inazo.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps publishing the languages it already has.'=>'Haikuweza kufikia Zinn Digital®. Tovuti yako inaendelea kuchapisha lugha ambazo tayari inazo.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps publishing the languages it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® ilijibu kwa kitu ambacho hatukuweza kusoma. Tovuti yako inaendelea kuchapisha lugha ambazo tayari inazo.']];